Well, it took a long time, and I think this game proves that I have some 
sort of compulsive disorder. I made three passes through all the dungeon 
to make sure I'd gotten everything, but it looks like I missed a few 
things. I had terrible luck with skeletons, and I didn't even bother 
with mailer demons. I didn't see a few of the demon princes either. I 
left a few priests of Anhur alive in the dungeon, but other than that, 
everything I could find was killed. And when create monster stops 
working, its time to go home (if you can believe it, it wasn't really 
boring until that happened).

Anyways, I'm off to buy my wife something nice so she'll stop referring 
